# Trained artefacts.
# models/heuristic.npz, training_report.json and training_history.npz are
# committed on purpose (67 KB total) so the game and the AI Lab work on a fresh
# clone without anyone having to train first. They are simply not listed here.
# To keep the repository source-only instead, add `models/` below and rebuild
# with `python main.py train`.
models/benchmark.npz

# Editors / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Scratch files (throwaway probes named _smoke1.py, _probe.py, ...)
_*.py
# ...but that pattern also matches __init__.py, which would silently drop every
# package marker and leave a fresh clone unable to import anything.
!**/__init__.py

*.log
screenshots/tmp/
